            <p style="margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#aaaaaa;line-height:1.8;">
              <a href="https://www.highereddive.com/news/higher-ed-groups-urge-gsa-rescind-anti-dei-certification-proposal/816280/" style="color:#c9963a;text-decoration:none;">Higher Ed Dive — Higher Ed Groups vs. GSA</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;
