              <a href="https://news.syr.edu/academic-portfolio-review-update-2/" style="color:#c9963a;text-decoration:none;">Syracuse University — Official Announcement</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;
              <a href="https://dailyorange.com/2026/04/syracuse-university-sunset-93-programs-academic-portfolio-review/" style="color:#c9963a;text-decoration:none;">Daily Orange — Campus Coverage</a>
            </p>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>

    </td>
